Keypath Repairs — FAO Edrin Moss. Re: Unit 2, 18 Brindlewick Mews, Orellin ZZ1 1ZZ (window sash locks and missing key).

Our file does not yet contain any record of attendance for this job. On 17 September you told us management keys had not been collected and no date could be given; on 22 and 25 September you told us the work was completed on Friday 19 September. We have no confirmed appointment, no visit notes, no photographs and no invoice.

Please send, by 5pm on Monday 29 September 2025:
1. the date and time of attendance and who attended;
2. how access was obtained (management keys were never signed out from this office — please confirm whether they were collected and, if so, when they will be returned);
3. a description of the work carried out on each sash (bedroom, bathroom, kitchen) and whether a new key was supplied;
4. photographs of the completed work;
5. your invoice, itemised, showing VAT.

Please also note whether you observed mould in the bathroom.

Until that evidence is received we cannot record the job as complete or pass any invoice to the landlord for payment. If we have no reply by the deadline the job will be reviewed by the office for reassignment.
